          "title": "docs(auth): correct OAuth client ID requirements for the Git credential helper",
          "message": "docs(auth): correct OAuth client ID requirements for the Git credential helper\n\nglab's built-in OAuth client ID only covers GitLab.com. On GitLab\nSelf-Managed and GitLab Dedicated, an administrator must set up an\nOAuth application and users must set client_id.\n\nAlso condense the Git credential helper section, and clarify that\ninteractive login already offers the helper setup.\n\nRelated to #8701\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
